# Local AI/tool directories
.agents/
.codex/
.cursor/

# Local diagnostic artifacts
artifacts/

# Outdated/superseded local working files (audit reports, prompts, old build outputs)
outdated/

# Local reference clones pulled by audit agents (ps2sdk / OPL / gsKit / ps2-packer)
.codex_refs/

# POPStarter-docs site source.
#
# The generator and the corpus it needs ARE tracked (negations below) so the
# published site can be rebuilt by anyone, not just one machine. Until 2026-07-28
# build_site.py existed in no branch at all: the popsloader/*.html doc mirrors had
# gone a full release era stale because only one person could regenerate them, and
# a disk failure would have made the recovered POPStarter archive unrebuildable.
#
# Tracked set verified sufficient: a clean-room rebuild from exactly these files
# reproduced all 246 published files byte-for-byte (only the archive .zip differs,
# because zips embed timestamps).
#
# Everything else here is bulky research scratch (_codex_archive, _compare,
# _mergebak, _merged, _audit, _thread, _tmp working files, the vendored nhddl
# reference, and the generated site/ output) and stays ignored.
.research/*
!.research/build_site.py
!.research/audit_site.py
!.research/README.md
!.research/wiki/
!.research/research/
!.research/firstparty/
!.research/assets/
!.research/assets/**
# The global *.7z / archive rules above would otherwise eat 9 of the 22 recovered
# downloads, and a clone missing them rebuilds a site that quietly serves fewer
# files than the archive is supposed to preserve. Re-include everything here.
!.research/downloads/
!.research/downloads/**
!.research/_srcassets/
!.research/_state/
# _html/ (the 34 MB of raw Wayback snapshots) is deliberately NOT tracked: 186 of its
# 526 files carry an AWS-key-shaped token, two apiece, i.e. archive.org wrapper
# boilerplate rather than any POPStarter secret -- but GitHub push protection rightly
# refuses credential-shaped data in a public repo, and bypassing it is not the answer.
# The only thing the build took from those files was the per-page image galleries, now
# pre-extracted into _state/galleries.json. Verified: a rebuild with _html/ absent
# reproduces all 246 published files byte-for-byte. Keep the snapshots locally if you
# have them; re-running the build with _html/ present just refreshes the cache.
!.research/_tmp/
.research/_tmp/*
!.research/_tmp/dl_manifest.tsv
!.research/_tmp/found_mirrors.tsv

# Ensure specific tracked binary assets stay visible
!bin/POPSLDR/POPSTARTER.ELF
# POPStarter build variants (MAIN/DEBUG/USBDELAY/USBDELAY_DEBUG) -- shipped in releases
# renamed "POPSTARTER VERSIONS". Negate past the blanket *.elf rule above.
!bin/POPSLDR/PROFILES/**
!iop/embed/BDMASSAULT_MX4SIO/*.irx
!POPSTARTER/*.irx

# Python bytecode cache (build tooling)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
